 "text": "The only thing I don't like about castor oil is how thick and messy it is. You're trying to apply a little, and suddenly it's dripping down your hands and getting everywhere. And let's be for real, the smell isn't exactly something you want lingering all day. But if you know, you know. Castor oil is liquid gold. But this roll-on? Freaking genius. No pouring, no oily fingers, just roll it exactly where you want it. It's USDA organic, cold pressed, and hexane-free with a rose quartz roller. I'm gonna do y'all a favor and link it in the orange cart. If you want conditioned brows, softer cuticles, moisturized skin, and hair growing longer, smoother, and shinier, you know what to do",
